model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway.poolMembership {
    metadata {
      constraint "Membership authority remains fresh under the existing exclusive reconciliation transaction. Only opaque reference material is reused after fresh row locks and exact metadata/ciphertext comparison. Registered acquisition configuration and credential-key epochs partition reuse through the preserved acquisition-host service identity; unknown hosts and missing references bypass it. The isolate bound is sixteen views of 256 KiB each. Mirror preparation runs outside the org lock only on fresh drift, followed by a reread; signed response fields and five-second renewal remain unchanged. Initial Worker membership reads are shared per pool, and callback-driven refresh waits for initialization before reading fresh authority. No host snapshot is reused for renewal."
    }
  }
}
